				TIMES SOURCE:L_TARGET:아픔 , 0.10
			ELSEIF TALENT:L_PLAYER:281 == 1
				TIMES SOURCE:L_TARGET:아픔 , 0.00
				TIMES SOURCE:L_TARGET:반감 , 0.60
			ELSEIF TALENT:L_PLAYER:281 == 2
